{"id":1020304,"chapter_id":1020304,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"你的话让黛伦有些惊讶，她哼哼地笑了两声，眼睛眯成了一条线，牢牢地盯着你。","style":3,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"看来……你甚至知道了一些我都不知道的事情？","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_1"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"options":["想知道吗？"],"style":6,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304003,"trial_step":3,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"想知道吗？","goto":4}]},{"step":4,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"我得承认，我有点好奇。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"content":"这家工厂，是这里的老牌工厂了，只不过三年前，它的厂牌名更新为杰米奈。","style":2,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"content":"它现在的主理人也姓杰米奈，但他并非这家工厂的老板——他的姐姐，才是这家工厂真正的主人。","style":2,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"content":"老板的姐姐死后，本来应该由弟弟继承这家工厂，可是他不愿意，依旧做着他副董事长的职位。","style":2,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"content":"同时，他还雇佣了一些特殊的工人——为了反抗逼婚而出逃的女孩，被迫出卖脏器养活弟妹的小哥，以及无数不愿让命运踩在脚底的人。","style":2,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"content":"黛伦看着零星走出来的人，猛地意识到了什么。","style":3,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"这是？","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"是电影最后那个女孩对吗？身穿西装的女孩。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"content":"多亏她的弟弟在两年后将工厂的名字改了，我才能找到这里。","style":2,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"content":"前段时间，我找他聊了一下，他还记得与你相识的那天。","style":2,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"content":"黛伦看向那块比起工厂围墙崭新不少的招牌，点了点头说道。","style":3,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"我也还记得。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"这部电影的最初灵感……就来源于他姐姐的日记。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"我是在一个旧货铺里，找到这本日记的。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"旧货商店里的每一样商品，几乎都代表着一段故事。所以我很喜欢去这里面寻找灵感，于是便碰上了那本日记。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"content":"黛伦拉着你坐在了厂牌下方的种满玫瑰花的花基上，讲述着那段奇幻的经历。","style":3,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"我起初以为这本写满了金融商政的笔记本，是一位男士的日记，直到我看到了后面她抱怨母亲不愿意让她继续和弟弟一起学习，而是让她去学习钢琴和小提琴。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"我这才意识到自己的想法有多刻板——就和她的母亲一样。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"这本日记本里，写下了她一生的经历和感悟，我熬夜翻看完，看到了一个即便被命运踩在脚底，也要用尽全力呐喊的强大灵魂。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"她立志经商，弟弟也支持她的梦想，可是无论怎样，都拗不过父母的手掌。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"羽翼还未长成，便被拢在了笼中。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"她与世交的朋友强行结合，在硕大的别墅里用笔墨讨伐呐喊……却最终因难产而亡。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"content":"你的枷锁突然猛烈地跳动起来，你知道这是危险的信号，可你并不愿意阻止黛伦——","style":3,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"content":"女孩笔下的文字，深深印在了黛伦的脑海中，它们将你和黛伦的时间固定在五至七时——那天的黛伦在这个时间段里，读完了整本日记。","style":3,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"content":"这些文字变成冰冷的现实，一遍又一遍地在你与黛伦面前上演。","style":3,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304028,"trial_step":28},{"step":29,"content":"她懦弱，但她也很勇敢。","style":2,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"终点来临那一刻，她成为了自己的英雄。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"content":"你伸出手，看着黛伦，她默默地笑了笑，将手搭在了你的上方。","style":3,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304031,"trial_step":31},{"step":32,"content":"枷锁从你的腕骨处延伸到她的手上，红色的荆棘缠绕，眼前的画面终于定格，变成了一副女子的画像，最终在你们面前熊熊燃烧。","style":3,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"content":"灰烬落下，时间开始流转，就像刚才什么事也没发生过一样。","style":3,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304033,"trial_step":33},{"step":34,"content":"那部电影不该是这样的结局，他们需要喊出自己最真实的想法。","style":2,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"是啊，但它只能是这样的结局，大家也只能看到这样的结局。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"content":"我和杰米奈先生聊天的时候，谈论到了这部电影。","style":2,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304036,"trial_step":36},{"step":37,"content":"我想说的是……杰米奈先生之所以会决定将工厂改名，都是因为你的这部电影。","style":2,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304037,"trial_step":37},{"step":38,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"是吗？这工厂本来就是他的，叫杰米奈……也很正常吧。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304038,"trial_step":38},{"step":39,"options":["但你看这里。"],"style":6,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304039,"trial_step":39,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"但你看这里。","goto":40}]},{"step":40,"content":"你指了指黛伦的帽子，她往后仰着，看到了厂牌最前面，一个漂亮的，被玫瑰花簇拥着的字符——MISS。","style":3,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304040,"trial_step":40},{"step":41,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_40"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304041,"trial_step":41},{"step":42,"content":"杰米奈先生告诉我，姐姐虽然按照父母的意愿嫁了人，却从没放弃过自己的梦想，她依然想向世界喊出自己的声音，所以才会写日记。","style":2,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304042,"trial_step":42},{"step":43,"content":"她去世后，遗物不慎被管家卖掉，却不曾想这么巧，日记本流转到了你的手里。","style":2,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"content":"他在第一次看到电影的时候，就知道那个穿西装的女孩一定是自己的姐姐，又或者……是无数和自己姐姐一样的女孩的缩影。","style":2,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304044,"trial_step":44},{"step":45,"content":"尽管最后的结局和他想的不太一样，但他觉得很美好——原谅他，毕竟，那个版本的电影里，女孩至少活着。","style":2,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304045,"trial_step":45},{"step":46,"content":"黛伦摊手，叹了口气。","style":3,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304046,"trial_step":46},{"step":47,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"其实也难为他们，从不知道哪条废片里，剪出了这么个镜头，拼成一个这样的结局。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"content":"但也正是因为这个“美好”的结局，他决定继承姐姐的梦想，让这个世界看到姐姐。","style":2,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304048,"trial_step":48},{"step":49,"content":"他改了工厂的名字，找到和电影里那些人一样坚强却困苦的人，来这座工厂做工，还让姐姐永远地成为工厂的老板。","style":2,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304049,"trial_step":49},{"step":50,"content":"你站起来，走到了黛伦面前。","style":3,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304050,"trial_step":50},{"step":51,"content":"抱歉，就算这本手札是你故意遗留给我的，但带你来这里，可能……也稍微有点越界吧？","style":2,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304051,"trial_step":51},{"step":52,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"不，我不觉得，只要你喜欢，带我去哪儿都行——你不是就这样把我带进MBCC的吗？","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304052,"trial_step":52},{"step":53,"options":["……我感觉其实你挺记仇的。"],"style":6,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304053,"trial_step":53,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"……我感觉其实你挺记仇的。","goto":54}]},{"step":54,"content":"咳咳，我想说的不是这个。","style":2,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304054,"trial_step":54},{"step":55,"content":"我是想说……别让现实束缚自己，那些无用的胶片缠住你，给你贴上标签，被迫让你接受现实。","style":2,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304055,"trial_step":55},{"step":56,"content":"因为——你现在不是普通人了啊，黛伦导演。","style":2,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304056,"trial_step":56},{"step":57,"content":"黛伦撑着下巴，抬眼看着你，脸上的笑容愈发明显。","style":3,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304057,"trial_step":57},{"step":58,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"是，我现在最能震撼他人的身份可是——MBCC收容的凶恶之人，禁闭者是也。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304058,"trial_step":58},{"step":59,"content":"那这位禁闭者小姐，想不想在全世界面前，撕掉束缚你的一切和限制你的标签，让大家看到那部真正的电影？","style":2,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304059,"trial_step":59},{"step":60,"content":"你的问题让黛伦有一瞬的疑惑，但看了看你，又看了看手上的手札，她似乎明白了你的想法。","style":3,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304060,"trial_step":60},{"step":61,"content":"她扯着你的手站了起来，笑得有些让人想到“一肚子坏水”之类的词语。","style":3,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304061,"trial_step":61},{"step":62,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"想不到MBCC的局长，竟然能想到这么疯的主意？","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_61"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304062,"trial_step":62},{"step":63,"content":"毕竟我总是和“疯子们”打交道。","style":2,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304063,"trial_step":63},{"step":64,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"谢谢夸奖，我很喜欢。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_63"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304064,"trial_step":64},{"step":65,"content":"天色已经完全暗了下来，但你还是看到，黛伦的眼中，倒映着她看到的一切——有和星星一样耀眼的光芒。","style":3,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304065,"trial_step":65},{"step":66,"content":"转眼间，延期许久的狄斯卡终于再次开办，整个新城热闹非凡。","style":3,"background":2041,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304066,"trial_step":66},{"step":67,"content":"有了前期对黛伦导演将携带新片至狄莱坞上映的大肆宣传，开办狄斯卡的场地前，聚集了比平时多上两倍的记者。","style":3,"background":2041,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304067,"trial_step":67},{"step":68,"content":"而所有人心心念念的黛伦导演，此时却带着你，出现在了狄斯卡场地的后门。","style":3,"background":2041,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304068,"trial_step":68},{"step":69,"content":"为什么每次见到你，你都在走后门？","style":2,"background":2041,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304069,"trial_step":69},{"step":70,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"哎，这里清净嘛，你肯定也不想被那些咔嚓咔嚓的玩意儿包围，一步也前进不了吧？","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_69"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2041,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304070,"trial_step":70},{"step":71,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"放心，交给我，这里我熟——虽然是溜出来的路。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_70"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2041,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304071,"trial_step":71},{"step":72,"content":"黛伦带着你，真的一路上都躲掉了那些不知道从哪里冒出来的记者。","style":3,"background":2041,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304072,"trial_step":72},{"step":73,"content":"但随着活动推进，你和黛伦在会场上坐下时，你才明白什么叫做……","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304073,"trial_step":73},{"step":74,"options":["是福不是祸，是祸躲不过。"],"style":6,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304074,"trial_step":74,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"是福不是祸，是祸躲不过。","goto":75}]},{"step":75,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"发发善心吧，局长大人，你就这么乐意看我出丑？","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_74"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304075,"trial_step":75},{"step":76,"content":"黛伦不着痕迹地凑到你耳边，面对镜头维持着微笑，从牙缝里挤出这句话来。","style":3,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304076,"trial_step":76},{"step":77,"content":"或许是为了更好地“利用”黛伦所带来的的噱头，这个主持人无论颁发什么奖，都要问一句黛伦。","style":3,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304077,"trial_step":77},{"step":78,"speaker":"主持人","content":"让我看看，接下来要颁发的是最佳化妆奖！","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_77"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304078,"trial_step":78},{"step":79,"speaker":"主持人","content":"不知道黛伦导演对这个化妆有没有什么看法呢？","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_78"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304079,"trial_step":79},{"step":80,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"化妆，或者说整体的服化道呢，虽然比起其他奖项似乎有些不起眼，但实际上，他们也非常重要。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_79"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304080,"trial_step":80},{"step":81,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"很多时候，角色的妆容，往往是能影响观众是否能入戏的第一步，所以呢……","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_80"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304081,"trial_step":81},{"step":82,"speaker":"主持人","content":"啊好的！好！说得好！接下来让我们看看提名的是哪些！","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_81"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304082,"trial_step":82},{"step":83,"content":"熬过了漫长的颁奖典礼，大会在万众瞩目的期待下，终于进入了样片播放环节。","style":3,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304083,"trial_step":83},{"step":84,"content":"面对前面播放的几部电影，在场的人们几乎都是公式化地鼓掌，叫好。","style":3,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304084,"trial_step":84},{"step":85,"content":"谈论感想时，模板化的发言让你想到了为了应付上级，让几位新城来的禁闭者代笔写的工作汇报。","style":3,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304085,"trial_step":85},{"step":86,"content":"但你也能理解大家的焦躁——毕竟，黛伦导演的作品，可是最后一个才出场。","style":3,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304086,"trial_step":86},{"step":87,"content":"下一个就轮到我们了，怎么样，准备好了吗？","style":2,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304087,"trial_step":87},{"step":88,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"当然，拭目以待。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_87"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304088,"trial_step":88},{"step":89,"content":"当主持人宣布接下来的影片是黛伦导演带来的新作，场下一片喝彩。","style":3,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304089,"trial_step":89},{"step":90,"content":"黛伦带着你走到台上，你接过播放样片的工作人员的活儿，让他走到台下去坐好。","style":3,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304090,"trial_step":90},{"step":91,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"看来大家很期待我的作品。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_90"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304091,"trial_step":91},{"step":92,"speaker":"观众","content":"是啊！","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_91"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304092,"trial_step":92},{"step":93,"speaker":"观众","content":"我们就是为这个来的！","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_92"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304093,"trial_step":93},{"step":94,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"感谢大家这么捧场，我很荣幸。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_93"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304094,"trial_step":94},{"step":95,"speaker":"观众","content":"我们永远支持你！","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_94"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304095,"trial_step":95},{"step":96,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"拍摄一部电影不容易，导演的想法和指挥固然重要，但也离不开所有工作人员的帮助。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_95"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304096,"trial_step":96},{"step":97,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"他们，亦是有梦想的人，亦是实现梦想的人。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_96"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304097,"trial_step":97},{"step":98,"speaker":"观众","content":"很厉害！快开始吧！！","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_97"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304098,"trial_step":98},{"step":99,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"剪辑也并非大家想象的那么……轻松？","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_98"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304099,"trial_step":99},{"step":100,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"就算脑子里有完整的分镜和想法，拍摄出来后，还需要一帧一帧将它们剪切，衔接。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_99"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304100,"trial_step":100},{"step":101,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"如果不是真的对它抱有爱意，这将会是史上最枯燥的活儿。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_100"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304101,"trial_step":101},{"step":102,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"但……也是掌控，甚至是能改变影片意义的工作。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_101"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304102,"trial_step":102},{"step":103,"content":"后面的荧幕还是一片漆黑，台下的观众早已按捺不住，他们开始朝黛伦不停地喊话。","style":3,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304103,"trial_step":103},{"step":104,"speaker":"观众","content":"说这么多做什么！开始播放电影吧！","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_103"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304104,"trial_step":104},{"step":105,"speaker":"观众","content":"对啊！让我们看看你的新作！","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_104"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304105,"trial_step":105},{"step":106,"speaker":"观众","content":"黛伦导演！打败前面的作品吧！","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_105"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304106,"trial_step":106},{"step":107,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_106"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304107,"trial_step":107},{"step":108,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"你们真的要现在立刻马上看吗？","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_107"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304108,"trial_step":108},{"step":109,"speaker":"观众","content":"对！马上就要看！！","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_108"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304109,"trial_step":109},{"step":110,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"真的……要看吗？","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_109"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304110,"trial_step":110},{"step":111,"speaker":"观众","content":"别卖关子了！","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_110"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304111,"trial_step":111},{"step":112,"speaker":"观众","content":"要看！","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_111"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304112,"trial_step":112},{"step":113,"speaker":"观众","content":"一定要看！！！","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_112"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304113,"trial_step":113},{"step":114,"content":"黛伦关闭了话筒，走到了舞台的最中间，她笑着，扫视了整个会场的观众们。","style":3,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304114,"trial_step":114},{"step":115,"content":"随后，她向大家深深地鞠了一躬。","style":3,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304115,"trial_step":115},{"step":116,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"好，那么……电影开始。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_115"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2044,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304116,"trial_step":116},{"step":117,"content":"你按下播放键，舞台背后的荧幕开始闪烁，诡异的红光瞬间，就将大家带回了五年前，那部怪诞浪漫的电影之中。","style":3,"background":2043,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304117,"trial_step":117},{"step":118,"content":"台下的人开始窃窃私语，不是新剧吗？为何跟五年前一模一样？","style":3,"background":2043,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304118,"trial_step":118},{"step":119,"content":"渐渐的，大家也发现了这部电影，与五年前上映那部，完全不一样。","style":3,"background":2043,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304119,"trial_step":119},{"step":120,"content":"镜头是一样的，内容是一样的，可是不同的剪辑手法，让它们表达的意义……完全不同了。","style":3,"background":2043,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304120,"trial_step":120},{"step":121,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"好好欣赏吧，这才是我当年……真正想要说出来的话。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_120"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2043,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304121,"trial_step":121},{"step":122,"content":"面对疯狂的画面，台下的观众开始坐立难安。","style":3,"background":2043,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304122,"trial_step":122},{"step":123,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"不好意思，各位，电影还没结束，请不要中途离场，好吗？","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_122"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2043,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304123,"trial_step":123},{"step":124,"content":"黛伦抬起手，看着台下表情各异的人们，发动了自己的异能——","style":3,"background":2043,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304124,"trial_step":124},{"step":125,"content":"你感受到了黛伦想象中的画面——玫瑰花瓣从天而降，掉落在了所有人的脚边。","style":3,"background":2043,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304125,"trial_step":125},{"step":126,"content":"那些花瓣层层叠叠，变成了让人无法离开的绳索，似乎要等电影中的花瓣流淌完毕，他们才能解脱。","style":3,"background":2043,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304126,"trial_step":126},{"step":127,"content":"台下哗然一片，看着眼前只剩麻木和泪痕的白裙少女朝自己怒吼，脸色苍白的男孩撕扯嵌入了肉体的藤蔓；身穿西服的少女燃烧了身边的一切，将红色一点一点吸入自己的钢笔中，在巨大的白色纸张上，写下自己疯狂的蓝图。","style":3,"background":2043,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304127,"trial_step":127},{"step":128,"content":"舞台上的黛伦朝你伸出了手，将你从幕后带到台前，一起向所有人行了个礼。","style":3,"background":2043,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304128,"trial_step":128},{"step":129,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"谢谢大家，谢谢当年所有的工作人员。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_128"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2043,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304129,"trial_step":129},{"step":130,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"谢谢当年愿意帮助我的人。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_129"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2043,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304130,"trial_step":130},{"step":131,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"谢谢赋予我灵感和故事的他们。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_130"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2043,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304131,"trial_step":131},{"step":132,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"谢谢让我重新成为“疯子”的你。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_131"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2043,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304132,"trial_step":132},{"step":133,"content":"最后一句话，黛伦转过头来，对着你说到。","style":3,"background":2043,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304133,"trial_step":133},{"step":134,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"这条红毯，五年前我没走过，怎么样，这次要不要和我一起走走？","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_133"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2043,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304134,"trial_step":134},{"step":135,"content":"当然，毕竟现在这场伟大的电影，我也是其中一员。","style":2,"background":2043,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304135,"trial_step":135},{"step":136,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"你何止是其中一员。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_135"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2043,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304136,"trial_step":136},{"step":137,"content":"黛伦握着你的手，带着你走下红毯，在所有人的注视下往出口走去。","style":3,"background":2043,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304137,"trial_step":137},{"step":138,"speaker":"黛伦","content":"在我眼里，你是主角。","voice":["vo_trial_20304_1_137"],"voice_bank":"vo_deren_trial","style":1,"background":2043,"log_type":1,"src_id":120304138,"trial_step":138}]}